{"ok": true, "content": "<fragment mode=\"keyword\" keyword=\"重点代码与阅读路径\"><h1 id=\"doxmy0aBINGzw8DGM1kgCvdpOOg\">补充：设计取舍、重点代码与阅读路径</h1><callout id=\"doxmyNTcZzpD1SfPSj3lCYjtPMh\" background-color=\"rgb(255,245,235)\" border-color=\"rgb(255,186,107)\" emoji=\"💡\"><p id=\"doxmyEcppxwysdaIoF6rpNqvd2e\"><b>设计目的：</b>持久化拆成 engine、repository、model，是为了兼容内存/SQLite/Postgres 等后端。</p></callout><table id=\"doxmy9U7FmW3pygWXt8nGUKBpId\"><colgroup><col width=\"118\"/><col width=\"531\"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align=\"top\"><p id=\"doxmytz0mKphOjMdN8CZsUcBEoc\">维度</p></th><th vertical-align=\"top\"><p id=\"doxmyLs4utjL43hSdSr6g29URib\">说明</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align=\"top\"><p id=\"doxmyhc8kcYo0L5qdfdUsQ2AwsX\">收益</p></td><td vertical-align=\"top\"><p id=\"doxmyHX7zMOqA7M98FXog164BpF\">收益是运行状态可恢复；代价是 schema、JSON 查询和用户隔离要严格。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align=\"top\"><p id=\"doxmyofLvXucskSNM2bS5UQVVhb\">代价</p></td><td vertical-align=\"top\"><p id=\"doxmySgPqBGJ2HKCozMaLBCWHvb\">见收益说明中的代价部分；此章节采用收益与代价合并描述。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align=\"top\"><p id=\"doxmyA7mr25m5CO93XWc2FyxbSh\">重点代码</p></td><td vertical-align=\"top\"><p id=\"doxmyZ6WmjLIW0O3AAQMmVtjjPb\">重点代码：<code>backend/packages/harness/deerflow/persistence</code>。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align=\"top\"><p id=\"doxmykZMe9kyeqeThhDYAz0Pbwf\">阅读路径</p></td><td vertical-align=\"top\"><p id=\"doxmyXZDyyr96ahu7B9WQNMQs6d\">阅读路径：model 定义表，repository 定义行为，engine 管连接。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><whiteboard id=\"doxcnBWcOny3Houog8Q8Zlj2aQ3\" token=\"HdRxwylgdh7CmtbIDzkmTOooy8d\" type=\"mermaid\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; pending: RunRepository.put\n  pending --&gt; running: update_status\n  running --&gt; success: update_run_completion\n  running --&gt; error: update_run_completion\n  running --&gt; running: update_run_progress\n  success --&gt; [*]\n  error --&gt; [*]\n  note right of pending: startup recovery via list_inflight</whiteboard></fragment>"}